    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a student at the prestigious school for heroes and, thanks to a magical birthmark, you are destined to become the most powerful person of your time. When an apocalyptic threat emerges, you are the only one capable of preventing the extinction of humanity and shaping the future of the world. Think carefully about your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single player campaign </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game made by one person, mostly </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game divided into &quot;chapters&quot;, where you can freely explore the map to complete the objectives of the main campaign or start side missions. Each chapter can offer more than one different ending. (All &quot;chapters&quot; are included in the game, do not require additional purchases)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIMPLICITY AND FUN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Book of Heroes is a classic RPG game where you take on the role of a student at the glorious school of heroes. But who are you really? A traditional hero, an anti-hero? Maybe it's something more sinister...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY FOCUS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was designed to offer an adaptive story, the player's choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shape the world around them, opening different paths and altering the story according</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to the decisions made. As such, it would take multiple playthroughs to see everything the game has to offer.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a student at the prestigious school for heroes and, thanks to a magical birthmark, you are destined to become the most powerful person of your time. When an apocalyptic threat emerges, you are the only one capable of preventing the extinction of humanity and shaping the future of the world. Think carefully about your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single player campaign </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game made by one person, mostly </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game divided into &quot;chapters&quot;, where you can freely explore the map to complete the objectives of the main campaign or start side missions. Each chapter can offer more than one different ending. (All &quot;chapters&quot; are included in the game, do not require additional purchases)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIMPLICITY AND FUN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Book of Heroes is a classic RPG game where you take on the role of a student at the glorious school of heroes. But who are you really? A traditional hero, an anti-hero? Maybe it's something more sinister...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY FOCUS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was designed to offer an adaptive story, the player's choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shape the world around them, opening different paths and altering the story according</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to the decisions made. As such, it would take multiple playthroughs to see everything the game has to offer.</p>",
    "short_description": "Discover the world of Ohnos, a place whose destiny is in your hands. In this game based on classic RPGs, think carefully about each decision, as they will shape the future of the world. After all, you are the chosen one!",
